{
  "uid": "rooms",
  "title": "Rooms",
  "tags": [
    "xaisen"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-5m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "room",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "Prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms, roomId)",
          "refId": "roomVariable"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active rooms",
      "description": "sum(dvconf_rooms_active) -- one cluster-wide number. dvconf_rooms_active is now emitted by cp-daemon's chain-observed room lifecycle (apps/cp-daemon/src/room-expiry-sweep.ts), a single source of truth rather than fragmented per-relay-replica gauges; sum() is kept as a safe no-op wrapper in case cp-daemon ever runs redundantly.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(dvconf_rooms_active)",
          "legendFormat": "rooms active",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Participants per room",
      "description": "count by (roomId) (dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId}) -- apps/relay/src/metrics-server.ts, one series per peerId reporting via POST /stats/report. dvconf_room_participants (formerly apps/signaling/src/rooms.ts, now apps/relay/src/signaling/index.ts) never counted bots, which connect straight to the relay's WS and never touch the old standalone signaling service at all; this metric is populated by both bots (apps/bot/src/stats-reporter.ts) and browser clients (useConnectionStats.ts) alike.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count by (roomId) (dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId=~\"$room\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{roomId}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Room duration distribution",
      "description": "dvconf_room_duration_seconds -- observed on room close, apps/cp-daemon/src/room-expiry-sweep.ts.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(dvconf_room_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le)",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency (All Users)",
      "description": "dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId,peerId} -- apps/relay/src/metrics-server.ts, aggregated (avg/min/max) across all peers currently in the room.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg(dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId=~\"$room\"}) by (roomId)",
          "legendFormat": "avg {{roomId}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "min(dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId=~\"$room\"}) by (roomId)",
          "legendFormat": "min {{roomId}}",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(dvconf_relay_peer_latency_ms{roomId=~\"$room\"}) by (roomId)",
          "legendFormat": "max {{roomId}}",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      }
    },
